Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在很久的过去 能量体就已经存在了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before time began, there was the Cube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道它从哪里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know not where it comes from, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只知道它拥有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}only that it holds the power…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造世界和生命的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to create worlds and fill them with life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这个种族就是这么诞生的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is how our race was born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直和谐地生活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a time, we lived in harmony, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像其它巨大的能量一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but like all great power, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们要它的目的有善有恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}some wanted it for good, others for evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以战争开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so began the war, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场使我们的星球…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a war that ravaged our planet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.20,0:01:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭的战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until it was consumed by death, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,能量体也丢失在浩瀚的宇宙里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Cube was lost to the far reaches of space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们搜寻了整个银河{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We scattered across the galaxy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望可以找到它来重建我们的家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hoping to find it and rebuild our home, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找每一个星球 每一个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}searching every star, every world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.50,0:01:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当我们都失去希望时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just when all hope seemed lost, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.45,0:01:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的线索…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}message of a new discovery…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们带到了一个星球叫做…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}drew us to an unknown planet called{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.30,0:02:01.80,Title,0,0,0,0,,《变形金刚》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.90,0:02:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们已经太迟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we were already too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.20,0:02:13.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中东 卡塔尔 当代）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.80,0:02:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 都已经5个月了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, five months of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.90,0:02:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都等不及要回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to get a little taste of home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想念我妈妈煮的鳄鱼肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A plate of mama's alligators touffe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这些鳄鱼肉…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been talking about barbecued 'gators…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.43,0:02:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,都说了2个星期了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and crickets for the last two weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.26,0:02:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓我一定不会去你妈妈那里吃饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never going to your mama's house, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.20,0:02:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,博比 鳄鱼肉是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Bobby, Bobby, 'gators are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了名的嫩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}known to have the most succulent meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请说英语好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}English, please. English.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过多少次了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how many times have we…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不讲西班牙语 我告诉过你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't speak Spanish. I told you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.40,0:02:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们干嘛总要破坏…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you got to ruin it for me, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己的传统呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my heritage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你随便说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go with the Spanish. Whatever{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还记得我们是怎么过周末的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys remember weekends? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在芬维公园看红袜队的比赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sox at Fenway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 美味的热狗和冰镇的啤酒 - 完美的一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cold hotdog and a flat beer. - Perfect day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长你呢？你也有完美的一天吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you, Captain? You got a perfect day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经等不及去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't wait to hold…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次抱我的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my baby girl for the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.90,0:03:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好男人啊 - 这真是太…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's adorable. - That's too…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm ready to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们谁有胆量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, any of y'all grow some balls, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就来操场上见我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}come see me on the court, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:36.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（卡塔尔特种作战司令部）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心我的胯下运球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this crossover, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像乔丹全盛时期一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Jordan in his prime, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿梭于锋线间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}pushing through the front line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让开点 小妞们 - 哦 伙计 搞什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Step aside, ladies. - Oh, man. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伦诺克斯！- 你好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lennox! - Hey, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要水吗？- 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Water? - Thank you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要帮我拿装备吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna help me with the gear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏普上校 有一身份不明的入侵者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Sharp, we have an inbound unidentified infiltrator, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离10英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 miles out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不明身份的飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unidentified aircraft, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现位于美军管制空域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are in restricted US military airspace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请表明身份并 向东飞行离开美军的领空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squawk ident and proceed east out of the area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛禽1号 2号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raptors one and two, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标方向250 进行拦截{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}snap to heading two-five-zero to intercept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.60,0:04:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标距离10英里 没表明身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bogie is in the weeds ten miles out, not squawking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不明身份的飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unidentified aircraft, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会护送你到美军桑克森空军基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will escort you to US SOCCENT airbase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.10,0:04:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不遵从 我们会使用致命的武力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do not comply, we will use deadly force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.10,0:04:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy the bogie{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.70,0:04:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,机尾编号4500X{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tail 4500 X-ray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 报告说4500X 在3个月前被击落了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, says here 4500 X was shot down three months ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在阿富汗 - 这一定是一个错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Afghanistan. - That's got to be a mistake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.90,0:04:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 检查 再检查 - 我检查过了 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check again, then recheck. - I did, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个朋友就在那架直升机上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend of mine was on that chopper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.30,0:04:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不明身份的飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unidentified aircraft, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.50,0:04:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会护送你到桑克森空军基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will escort you to US SOCCENT airbase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:04:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷达 飞行物在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radar, where's the inbound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标5英里 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bogie's five miles out, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我老婆在线吗？- 是的 队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My wife on? - Yes, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的女士们 - 看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My ladies! - Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 看啊 她都这么大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my goodness. Look at her. She's getting so big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看她的小脸 真想去亲一口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at those cheeks. I just wanna chew on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的孩子真是漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, we made a good-looking kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道人们总是这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that people say that all the time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们生了一个漂亮的孩子 干得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, wow, we made one good-Iooking kid. Nice work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她笑得真像你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has your laugh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她笑了？- 第一次呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She laughed? - Her first one, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定她刚刚没有放屁吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure she didn't just fart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 她可是个淑女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's a lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还不认识你 但是她会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't know you yet, but she will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.20,0:05:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,4500X 好像有些不对劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}4500 X. Something's not right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标着落了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bogie's on the deck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔喔喔 雷达被干扰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Radar's jammed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机是干扰源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming from the chopper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 威尔？- 莎拉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will? - Sarah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.80,0:05:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 如果你能听见我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sarah, if you can hear me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.70,0:05:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 我很快就会回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you and I'll be home soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到右边去 到右边去 - 检查弹药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To the right. Go to the right. - Check fire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.20,0:06:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,MH-53飞行员 关闭你的发动机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}MH-53 pilot, power down now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.30,0:06:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你的机组人员下机 不然我们会杀了你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have your crew step out or we will kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要开火！待命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire! Stand by to engage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们炸了通讯天线 我们被攻击了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They bombed the antenna farm! We're under attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是为了这些机密文件！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going after the files!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断总电源！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the hard lines!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要钥匙 它被锁上了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a key! It's locked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这边！到这边！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, come here! Come here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在这！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, hide in here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.10,0:08:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾普斯 快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Epps, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:59.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马歇尔高中）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,维特维奇先生 该你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Mr. Witwicky, you're up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我带了很多东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I got a lot of stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于我们家族…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my family…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.30,0:09:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁干的？谁干的？同学们 要有责任感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did… Who did that? People! Responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于家族史这个报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, for my family genealogy report, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.30,0:09:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算讲我的曾曾祖父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decided to do it on my great-great-grandfather, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.80,0:09:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个著名的人 阿奇伯尔德·维特维奇船长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was a famous man, Captain Archibald Witwicky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,著名的探索家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very famous explorer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.40,0:09:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 他是第一个去探索…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, he was one of the first to explore…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.60,0:09:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,北极的人 那是一件非常困难的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Arctic Circle, which is a big deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1897年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 1897, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带着41个勇敢的水手…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he took 41 brave sailors straight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,向北极出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the Arctic Shelf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家加把劲！快！举起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move faster, men! Move! Chop! Heave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰结的比它化的还要快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ice is freezing faster than it's melting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家再加把劲！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chop faster! Heave, men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 举起来！- 没有付出 就没有胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heave! - No sacrifice, no victory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会到达那里的 伙计们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get to the Arctic Circle, lads!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我要讲的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's the story, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里有一些基本资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we have some of the basic instruments…{\r}
