Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是四分仪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This here is the quadrant, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.95,0:10:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要80美元就可以给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which you can get for 80 bucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是要卖的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all for sale, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个六分仪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the sextant here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.75,0:10:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,50美元 非常超值{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}$50 for this, which is a bargain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个最酷了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are pretty cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是我曾曾祖父的眼镜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are my grandfather's glasses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没给它估价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't quite gotten them appraised yet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.15,0:10:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它见过很多有趣的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they've seen many cool things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要卖了他的肝吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to sell me his liver?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,维特维奇先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Witwicky, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是跳蚤市场 这是11年级的课堂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this isn't show and sell. It's the 11th grade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你的祖父不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think your grandfather would be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你所作所为感到骄傲的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}particularly proud of what you're doing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 对不起 这只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm sorry. I just, you know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是为了我的汽车基金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is all going towards my car fund.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以告诉其他人 我在易趣卖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can tell your folks. It's on eBay. I take PayPal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受贝宝和现金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold hard cash works, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,指南针是一个很好的哥伦布节的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the compass makes a great gift for Columbus Day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.50,0:10:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山姆 - 不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam! - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 我的曾曾祖父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, my great-great-grandfather, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然是个天才{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the genius that he was, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.80,0:10:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,却瞎了又疯了 被关进精神病院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}wound up going blind and crazy in a psycho ward, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,画这些奇怪的符号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}drawing these strange symbols{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.10,0:10:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,说一些关于他所发现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and babbling on about some giant ice man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.70,0:10:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨大的冰人的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he thought he'd discovered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许明天会有考试 也许不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Might be a pop quiz tomorrow. Might not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.40,0:10:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚在恐惧中入睡吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep in fear tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.55,0:11:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吗？50 40 30？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, you want? Here, 50. 40? 30?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山姆 - 对不起 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam? - Yeah. Sorry, sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.20,0:11:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不错 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Pretty good, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想B-是一个不错的成绩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say a solid B-.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给B-？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A B-?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.90,0:11:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我的课堂上说一些你曾曾祖父的无聊的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were hawking your great-grandfather's crap in my classroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 大家喜欢…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, kids enjoy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.30,0:11:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能帮个忙吗？- 干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, can you do me a favor? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看一下窗外吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you look out the window for a second?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到我父亲了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see my father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐在绿色的车里 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's the guy in the green car. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.80,0:11:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉你一个梦想 一个男孩的梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I wanna tell you about a dream. A boy's dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个男人答应那个男孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a man's promise to that boy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.40,0:11:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看着我的眼睛说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looked at me in the eye. He said, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.80,0:11:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 我会给你买一辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Son, I'm gonna buy you a car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.30,0:11:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你需要给我2000美元和3个A{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"But I want you to bring me $2, 000 and three As."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.70,0:11:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经有了2000美元和2个A{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I got the 2, 000 and I got two As.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的梦想 你的B-梦想破灭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Here's the dream. Your B-. Dream gone. Kaput.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你自问一下 如果是上帝 他会怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, just ask yourself, what would Jesus do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 太棒了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,A- 但也算A{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-. It's an A, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 我看不清楚 是A 没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. I can't see. It's an A.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么 通过啦？- 通过啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So I'm good? - You're good{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个惊喜给你 儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a little surprise for you, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:11:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的惊喜？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:11:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小小的惊喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a little surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 爸爸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no, no. Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:05.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（保时捷车行）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你一定是在开玩笑 - 看？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, you got to be kidding me. - See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我是在开玩笑 你不会得到一辆保时捷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I am. You're not getting a Porsche{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为那很可笑吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that's funny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 非常可笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think it's funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.10,0:12:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么回事？- 你真以为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong with you? - You think I'd really{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你买的第一辆车就是保时捷？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}get you a Porsche for your first car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以后不会再和你谈这件事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to talk to you for the rest of this whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 拜托 就是个现实的玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. It's just a practical joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点不好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a funny joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.80,0:12:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 曼尼！- 怎么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Manny! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让你表弟穿这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your cousin out of that damn clown suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他热得发晕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's having a heat stroke again.{\r}
