Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.90,0:12:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很热！妆要化了 我眼睛疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hot! Makeup's melting. It hurts my eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这？不！这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here? No, no, no, what is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你说过半辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said… You said half a car, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是半辆破烂 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not half a piece of crap, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我像你这么大时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was your age, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.90,0:12:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,能有辆车就很开心了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have been happy with four wheels and an engine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来解释解释 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let me explain something to you. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.00,0:12:47.30,Title,0,0,0,0,,- 看没看过《40岁的处男》？- 看过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ever see 40-Year-Old Virgin? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 这就是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's what this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.95,0:12:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是50岁的处男{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is 50-year-old virgin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 你想我以后变成这样吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - You want me to live that life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有付出 就没有胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sacrifice, no victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 没有胜利 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no victory. You know, I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道这句维奇家的格言 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The old Witwicky motto, Dad. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:12:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比·玻利维亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby Bolivia, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那个国家 除了不是逃来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the country, except without the runs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.20,0:13:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要点什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子要买他的第一辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my son here, looking to buy his first car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你来找我了？- 没办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You come to see me? - I had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就是一家人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That practically makes us family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.00,0:13:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以叫我鲍比·B叔叔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Bobby B, baby. Uncle Bobby B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.80,0:13:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山姆 - 山姆 我来跟你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - Sam, let me talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.60,0:13:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 你的第一道大餐…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, your first enchilada of freedom…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.85,0:13:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}awaits underneath one of those hoods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.90,0:13:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you something, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是驾驶员挑车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A driver don't pick the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是车挑驾驶员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car'll pick the driver{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是人类和汽车间的缘分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a mystical bond between man and machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 我本事很大的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, I'm a lot of things, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.65,0:13:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不包括吹牛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a liar's not one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其不在我妈妈面前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially not in front of my mammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我妈妈 嘿 妈咪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my mammy. Hey, Mammy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是有块石头 就砸你的头 婊子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had a rock, I'd bust your head, bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 伙计 她聋了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, man, she deaf, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, over here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.70,0:13:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,每辆都不错 都是你所想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}every piece of car a man might want or need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't bad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这车有赛车的条纹 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This one's got racing stripes. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.30,0:13:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有条纹…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It got racing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.30,0:14:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是哪辆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what's this? What the heck is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know nothing about this car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 曼尼！- 干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Manny! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.50,0:14:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁的车？去查一下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? This car! Check it out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 老板 我以前没见过！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, boss! I've never seen it! That's loco!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别唬我 曼尼 快去查查！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go Ricky Ricardo on me, Manny! Find out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.90,0:14:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多少钱 - 这个嘛…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much? - Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据这辆车的外形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering the semi-classic nature of the vehicle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和特别的喷漆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the slick wheels and the custom paint job…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,漆已经掉色了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but the paint's faded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.30,0:14:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是喷漆是特殊的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but it's custom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.60,0:14:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是特殊的掉色漆吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's custom faded?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.80,0:14:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你第一辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is your first car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不指望你明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't expect you to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,5千{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five grand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不会超过4千{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not paying over four. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.80,0:14:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 从车里出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, come on, get out. Get out the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 但是你说车挑驾驶员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You said cars pick their drivers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 有时那个驾驶员…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sometimes they pick a driver…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个抠门的父亲 快下车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a cheap-ass father. Out the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.50,0:14:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边这辆就4千美元了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this one here for four Gs is a beaut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那车也有赛车的条纹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a Fiesta with racing stripes over there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.00,0:14:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要那个带条纹的福特嘉年华{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't want a Fiesta with racing stripes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这车有一个经典的引擎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a classic engine right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.90,0:14:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,前几天卖一辆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sold a car the other day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:14:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee. Holy cow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不不不 别担心 - 你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no. No worries. - You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去弄个大锤把这个敲下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get a sledgehammer and knock this right out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.70,0:15:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 曼尼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, Manny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你表弟弄些锤子来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your clown cousin and get some hammers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这东西敲下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and come bang this stuff out, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.10,0:15:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,…比人类伟大…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… greater than man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那辆我最喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one's my favorite, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.30,0:15:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路从阿拉巴马开过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}drove all the way from Alabammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.60,0:15:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,4千{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}$4, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:36.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（华盛顿特区）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.40,0:15:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 部长先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mr. Secretary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们太年轻了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're so young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是最好的主题专家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the top subject matter experts, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年国家安全局直接从高中招人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}NSA's recruiting right out of high school these days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:16:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,同伴们 那是国防部部长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, that's the Secretary of Defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我穿的衣服真不适合这个场合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so underdressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.20,0:16:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们 国防部部长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, the Secretary of Defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be seated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是约翰·凯勒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm John Keller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该想知道你们为什么会在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, you're wondering why you're here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.80,0:16:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so these are the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在昨天当地时间19时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At 1900 local time yesterday, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在卡塔尔的桑克森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the SOCCENT Forward Operations…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,美军基地被攻击了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base in Qatar was attacked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,具目前所了解的资料 没有幸存者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far as we know, there were no survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.60,0:16:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击的目的是为了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The objective of the attack…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,侵入军方的电脑网络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was to hack our military network{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.50,0:16:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不知道他们要找什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not sure exactly what they're after, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we do know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的侵入被阻止了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they were cut off during the assault, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.80,0:16:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们认为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which would lead us to assume…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会再次袭击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they're going to try it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.10,0:16:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前无人为攻击事件负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, no one's taken responsibility for the attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在唯一的线索…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the only real lead we have so far…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is this sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是侵入我们系统的信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the signal that hacked our network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.90,0:17:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,国家安全局正在全力分析它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}NSA's working at full capacity to analyze it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望来拦截未来的通讯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and intercept further communications, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你来找出谁是幕后的主脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we need your help to find out who did this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.60,0:17:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都有很强的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you've all shown considerable ability…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号分析技能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the area of signals analysis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在情况紧急{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on a hair-trigger here, people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.10,0:17:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统已经派出航母舰队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The President has dispatched battle groups{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,前往波斯湾和黄海{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Arabian Gulf and Yellow Sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.10,0:17:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不会比这更严重了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is as real as it's ever gonna get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会由负责的官员领导{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm gonna leave you to your officer-in-charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,领队们会把你们分成小组…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll break up into teams…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll start your work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.30,0:17:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝我们好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck to us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 魔球 我有车了 我需要一个女朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Mojo. I got the car. Now I need the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还需要钱带她出去玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need money to take out the girl is what I need{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.60,0:17:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,0个竞标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero bids{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 身无分文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Broke{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 魔球 你想要止痛药吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Mojo. You want your pain pills?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.90,0:17:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没熟透{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Premature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 只是在开我的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. You know, just driving my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.50,0:17:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开我的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driving my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.90,0:18:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是时钟发条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like clockwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这东西让你恍惚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I know you get wasted on these things, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要是再在我床上撒尿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you piss in my bed again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.80,0:18:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就到外面睡去 明白？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're sleeping outside. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.10,0:18:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天到此为止了 别吃了 瘾君子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it for today. No more. Crackhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 荣恩 这里不平 - 是 也许吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ron, this one is uneven. - Yeah. Probably.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这块要掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is wobbly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我会解决它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'll take care of that real soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能不能请一个专业的人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't we have hired a professional?{\r}
