Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想在我的草坪上看到脚印{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not like footprints on my grass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…？没脚印啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What foot… There's no footprints.{\r}
