Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.40,0:18:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不从草地移到入门径上来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you go from my grass onto my path, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这草是属于整个家的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's family grass, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你拥有你自己的草地的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when you own your own grass, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会明白的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…我受不了了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This… I can't do it anymore{\r}
