Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.10,0:18:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他的首饰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's his bling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在11点前回家！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you home at 11:00!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.10,0:18:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 11点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, all right. - 11:00!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.00,0:18:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上 小心开车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, for the love of God, drive safely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.30,0:18:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,系上安全带！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seat belt on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.40,0:18:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 你可真小气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. You are so cheap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:19:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他的第一辆车 应该是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's his first car. Supposed to be like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.40,0:19:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前 我们无法确认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this time, we can't confirm…{\r}
