Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.60,0:19:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在进入防御状况四{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our bases worldwide are, as of now, at DEFCON Delta, {\r}
