Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们面对着一个从未见过的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dealing with a very effective weapons system{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常强大的武器系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we have not come across before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会为那些勇敢的士兵祈祷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But our prayers are with the families of the…{\r}
