Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.30,0:19:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有无形的能量罩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing as invisible force fields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.70,0:19:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了在漫画里 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}except in, like, comic book stuff, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.00,0:19:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不明白 - 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Man, I don't know. - What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老妈 她有种天赋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mama, she had the gift, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以看到未来 我也有她的遗传{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saw things. I got the gene, too, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.10,0:19:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个攻击我们的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that thing that attacked us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.90,0:19:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我预感它还会再来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a feeling it ain't over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.60,0:19:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不用你的巫术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you use those magic voodoo powers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get us the hell out of here, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:20:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我照相的时候 我想它看到我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I took that picture, I think it saw me.{\r}
