Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要马上把它…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we got to get this thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.30,0:20:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,送到五角大楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}back to the Pentagon right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要知道我们的敌人是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got to know what we're dealing with here.{\r}
