Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,天线没有信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no communication with aerial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.70,0:20:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,马弗斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mahfouz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家离这里有多远？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far do you live from here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不远了 翻过那座山就到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not far. Just up that mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那里有电话吗？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do they have a phone? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's hit it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你确定我们被邀请了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, are you sure we're invited to this party?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.90,0:20:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 迈尔斯 那是一个湖 是公共场所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, Miles. It's a lake. Public property.{\r}
