Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.75,0:20:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别做奇怪的事 好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't do anything weird, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看上不错 对不对？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm good, right? - Yeah, you're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 各位 快看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.20,0:20:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.30,0:20:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 你的车不错 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bro. That car. It's nice. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:20:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来这里干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you guys doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这里爬这棵树{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to climb this tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见了 很有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see that. It looks… It looks fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 我想我认识你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - You know, I thought I recognized you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.50,0:21:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去年参加过橄榄球队的预选 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried out for the football team last year, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家找你妈妈吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go call your mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.40,0:21:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 那是… 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, that… No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.35,0:21:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不是想参加预选{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't like a real tryout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.40,0:21:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在为写的书收集资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was researching a book I was writing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 是吗？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.60,0:21:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦？关于什么的？一塌糊涂的体育运动？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? What's it about? Sucking at sports?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.50,0:21:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那是关于…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's about the link…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,橄榄球和大脑受损的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}between brain damage and football.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.30,0:21:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一本好书 你的朋友会喜欢它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's a good book. Your friends'll love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.60,0:21:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有上色的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's got mazes in it and, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,立体折叠…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, little coloring areas, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.90,0:21:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有图片 非常有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}sections, pop-up pictures. It's a lot of fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.90,0:21:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 不要这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. You know what? Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去参加聚会吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, I know of a party. Let's go, let's head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快从树上下来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to get out of the tree right now. Get…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快下来 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get out of the tree right now, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.90,0:21:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到下来的动作了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that dismount?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩们都在看我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the chicks were watching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.40,0:21:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你使我看起来像个傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making me look like an idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.60,0:21:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚才都像傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both looked like idiots just now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:21:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 让我开怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how about you let me drive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不不不 这不是玩具车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No, no, no. This is not a toy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.30,0:22:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个22英寸的轮胎 我不想你开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These 22s, I don't want you grinding them. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我可爱的小白兔…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why doesn't my little bunny…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不跳到后座上去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just hop in the back seat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.30,0:22:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天 我要告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I can't even tell you how much…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.00,0:22:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是你的小白兔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your little bunny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.30,0:22:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.80,0:22:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会来找我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll call me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 今晚谁开车送你回家？∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Who's gonna drive you home, tonight? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.80,0:22:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 你的收音机怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, what's wrong with your radio?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今晚我要送她回家 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna drive her home tonight. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.20,0:22:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可是个小骚货 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's an evil jock concubine, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.90,0:22:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她去搭车吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her hitchhike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.00,0:22:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她家离这里有10英里远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lives 10 miles from here, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我唯一的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my only chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.70,0:22:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要理解我 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be understanding here, all right?{\r}
