Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.60,0:22:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说坐前面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called shotgun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让她坐后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not putting her in the back.{\r}
