Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.80,0:27:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,“你并非徒有其表” 真傻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"There's more than meets the eye with you." Stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.00,0:27:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.80,0:27:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 我喜欢这车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. I love my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.80,0:27:49.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（五角大楼 国家军事指挥中心）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.30,0:27:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们 我想另一个小组找出原因了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, I think the other team figured it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.60,0:27:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊朗人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.00,0:28:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.10,0:28:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对伊朗科学家也太难了点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is way too smart for Iranian scientists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.70,0:28:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.30,0:28:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢？中国人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, kid? Chinese?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.90,0:28:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.70,0:28:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和中国所用的技术一点也不像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is nothing like what the Chinese are using.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.80,0:28:12.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（空军一号）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.90,0:28:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是空军一号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Air Force One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.80,0:28:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行高度330{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Level of flight, level three-three-zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.80,0:28:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找到这个敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will hunt down this enemy. And when we do, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.00,0:28:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时就能知道怎样对付他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll know just what to do with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.70,0:28:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.00,0:28:33.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美军基地遭受重创）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.70,0:28:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 幸存者很少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, there are very few survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.40,0:28:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mr. President?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.70,0:28:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我拿一点点心来好吗？亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, can you wrangle me up some Ding Dongs, darling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.80,0:28:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加入空军一号就是给他拿点心的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I joined the Air Force to bring the man Ding Dongs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.60,0:29:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去储藏室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be in storage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.20,0:29:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.40,0:29:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.10,0:30:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.70,0:30:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you getting this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.30,0:30:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们又在入侵军事网络了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they're hacking the network again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.90,0:30:20.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（侦测到外来信号）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.50,0:30:25.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（搜索“冰人计划”）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.80,0:30:26.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（找到结果）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.20,0:30:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.10,0:30:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个和卡塔尔的信号完全一致{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a direct match to the signal in Qatar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.40,0:30:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在进行信号分析吗？- 应该吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you running a diagnostic? - Should I be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.30,0:30:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该 - 我这就办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, you should. - So I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.00,0:30:48.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（开始上传文件）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.00,0:30:51.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（探测到病毒）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.50,0:30:52.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（无法识别文件上传中）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.50,0:30:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人！它们正入侵空军一号的网络！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone! They're hacking into Air Force One!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.90,0:30:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一个高级分析师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a senior analyst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.50,0:30:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想它们植入了一个病毒 - 病毒？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think they're planting a virus. - A virus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.50,0:30:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在传输{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's streaming right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.75,0:31:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在植入病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are planting a virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.10,0:31:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时还从我们系统上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stealing a whole lot of data…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.40,0:31:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,窃取了大量的信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from your system at the same time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.40,0:31:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色警报 网络被入侵了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code Red. We have a breach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.00,0:31:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军一号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air Force One, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.80,0:31:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人正在入侵军事网络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone onboard has breached the military network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.90,0:31:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,货舱没有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the cargo hold. Clear. Clear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.20,0:31:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们必须切断热线 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got to cut the hard lines. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.70,0:31:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不管它们想要什么 它们正在得逞 - 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whatever they want, they are getting it. - Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.00,0:31:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求切断防御网络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permission to take down the Defense Network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.80,0:31:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断所有服务器的连接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut all server hard lines now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.80,0:31:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断所有服务器的连接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut all server hard lines now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.50,0:31:30.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（连接中断）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.50,0:31:34.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（北极探险家称发现冰人）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.50,0:31:37.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发现者 维特维奇船长）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.50,0:31:40.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（终端停止）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.40,0:31:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人动过这里的主机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's tampered with the POTUS mainframe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.30,0:31:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.30,0:32:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,底舱有人开枪 重复 有人开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shots fired in the underdeck. Repeat, shots fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.80,0:32:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,机组 准备紧急降落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crew, prepare for emergency descent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.70,0:32:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要总统现在就进入地下掩体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want our President in that bunker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.80,0:32:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要在他安全后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want to discuss a damn thing other…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.00,0:32:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再讨论现在这个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}till that becomes reality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.90,0:32:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的首要目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our first priority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.10,0:32:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是我们现在的唯一目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our only priority right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.10,0:32:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军一号已经降落了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air Force One is on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.70,0:32:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚蠢的生物妄图朝我开枪{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.30,0:33:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了火种源的线索{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.50,0:33:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个姓维特维奇的人看到过我们的文字{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.80,0:33:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜索维特维奇{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.50,0:33:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须找到万人迷217{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.30,0:33:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 不 不 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. No, no, no, no, no, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.80,0:33:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.80,0:33:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.30,0:33:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.90,0:33:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 报警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, call the cops!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.80,0:34:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要开我的车去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going with my car, buddy? Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.00,0:34:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要报警 我的车被偷了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? 911 emergency! My car has been stolen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.90,0:34:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在追他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in pursuit! Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.20,0:34:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位和中队都要行动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need all units, the whole squadron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.30,0:34:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有人都叫来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring everyone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.50,0:34:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！别问为什么 行吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't ask me questions, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.40,0:34:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸是邻居保安计划主管！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father's the head of the neighborhood watch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.70,0:34:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.60,0:35:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫山姆·维特维奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Sam Witwicky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.10,0:35:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论谁看到这个 我的车活了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever finds this, my car is alive, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.50,0:35:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.20,0:35:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的遗言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since this is my last words on Earth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.15,0:35:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你爸爸 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna say, Mom, Dad, I love you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.10,0:35:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们从床下找到色情书刊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you find Busty Beauties under my bed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.80,0:35:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it wasn't mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.60,0:35:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是替迈尔斯在保存 不 等等…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm holding it for Miles. No, no, wait that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.80,0:35:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.40,0:35:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔叔叔给我的 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mine and Uncle Charles gave it to me. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.96,0:35:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔球 我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mojo, I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.80,0:35:29.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（内有恶犬）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.00,0:35:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！不！不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.60,0:35:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.60,0:35:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你是好狗 好狗 好狗！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're a good dog! Good dog! Good dog!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.80,0:35:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.60,0:35:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 嘿嘿嘿 喔 好吧！哦 哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Hey, hey, hey! Whoa! All right! Oh! oh! oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.30,0:35:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 求求你 别杀我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Please, please don't kill me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.50,0:36:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 钥匙给你了 我不要了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry! Take the keys! I don't want them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.90,0:36:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,车是你的了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car's yours!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.90,0:36:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 听着 听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, listen, listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.50,0:36:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真好 你们来了 - 把手举起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good, you're here. - Let me see your hands!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.90,0:36:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不不不 不是我 - 把手举起来让我看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no! It's not me! - Let me see your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.60,0:36:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy's inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.70,0:36:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,住嘴 走向警车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Walk towards the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.60,0:36:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把头顶到引擎罩上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your head on the hood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.60,0:36:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们终于还是侵入了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever did this finally managed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.95,0:36:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的防卫网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to infiltrate our defense network, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.40,0:36:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当时尝试侵入我们的卡塔尔基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is what they tried to do in Qatar, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.80,0:36:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这次他们得逞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}only this time it worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.10,0:36:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们都弄到了什么？- 目前还未知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did they get? - We still don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.80,0:36:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我病毒的情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me about the virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.35,0:36:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种蜘蛛型病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Spider-bot virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.00,0:36:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不了解它的作用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not sure what it's going to do, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.35,0:36:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过有可能会侵害我们的系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it may cripple the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.80,0:36:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们能阻止它吗？- 每一次我们想消灭它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we stop it? - Every time we try an antivirus, {\r}
