Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.65,0:57:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个超级先进的机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, this super-advanced robot, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.65,0:57:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么还要变回…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}does he transform back into…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.95,0:57:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么一坨烂车？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this piece-of-crap Camaro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.75,0:58:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！哇！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.15,0:58:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 这样不行 看见没？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, see? No. Get… No, that doesn't work. See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.05,0:58:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,开走！你个混蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it, you moron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.15,0:58:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下好了…看见没？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, now… See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.65,0:58:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太妙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.85,0:58:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他气跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you pissed him off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.05,0:58:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个车很敏感的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That car is sensitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.55,0:58:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的4000美金就这么跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, $4000 just drove off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.95,0:58:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.75,0:59:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.25,0:59:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.60,0:59:49.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我的乳牙）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.45,0:59:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.05,0:59:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我见过最酷的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the coolest thing I've ever seen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.75,0:59:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都在爆炸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explosions everywhere!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.85,1:00:01.85,Title,0,0,0,0,,比《绝世天劫》还要劲爆…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is easily a hundred times cooler…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.85,1:00:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百倍！我对天发誓！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than Armageddon. I swear to God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.95,1:00:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,着火了 着火了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire, fire, fire, fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.15,1:00:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Sweet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.85,1:00:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 伙计 我希望这家伙交了陨石险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dude, I hope this guy's got asteroid insurance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.15,1:00:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他太惨了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause he is so boned!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.25,1:00:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.15,1:00:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,树上有东西 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something in the tree, dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.85,1:00:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 树旁有什么东西！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's something in the thing by the tree!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.05,1:00:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能给我一块陨石吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you guys just give me a space rock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.70,1:01:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 请问你是不是牙仙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, are you the tooth fairy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.40,1:01:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sweetheart, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.40,1:01:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么一个人在这儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what are you doing out here by yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.90,1:01:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪！游泳池怎么了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy God! What happened to the pool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.05,1:02:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是山姆·詹姆斯·维特维奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Samuel James Witwicky, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.05,1:02:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿切邦·维特维奇的后代？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}descendent of Archibald Witwicky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.45,1:03:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道你的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.15,1:03:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.25,1:03:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Optimus Prime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.75,1:03:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来自…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are autonomous robotic…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.95,1:03:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞伯坦星球的机械生命体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}organisms from the planet Cybertron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.95,1:03:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以简称为汽车人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can call us Autobots for short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.35,1:03:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽车人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Autobots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.45,1:03:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是“超辣的辣妹”？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's cracking, little bitches?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.85,1:03:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的副手 爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My first lieutenant. Designation, Jazz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.85,1:03:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来这地方挺有型{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks like a cool place to kick it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.95,1:03:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪里学来的这种调子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? How did he learn to talk like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.95,1:03:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从互联网上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've learned Earth's languages…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.75,1:03:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,学到地球人的语言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the World Wide Web.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.05,1:03:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的武器专家 铁皮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My weapons specialist, Ironhide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.35,1:03:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天你感到好运降身吗 小子？- 别吓人了 铁皮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You feeling lucky, punk? - Easy, Ironhide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.05,1:03:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑啦 只是想给他秀一下我的大炮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kidding. I just wanted to show him my cannons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.55,1:03:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的医学专家 救护车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our medical officer, Ratchet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.85,1:03:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上的激素水平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy's pheromone level suggests…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.85,1:03:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,显示你想跟这位女士亲热{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he wants to mate with the female.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.35,1:03:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是你的守护者 你已经认识了 大黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already know your guardian, Bumblebee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.95,1:03:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,大黄蜂 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bumblebee, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.65,1:03:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,检测系统 嗯 挺好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check on the rep Yep, second to none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.45,1:03:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是我的守护者 哈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're my guardian, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.95,1:04:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的发声系统在战斗受到破坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His vocal processors were damaged in battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.55,1:04:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想办法把他治好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still working on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.05,1:04:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么在这里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.45,1:04:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来找火种源的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here looking for the All Spark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.10,1:04:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且一定要抢在威震天前面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we must find it before Megatron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.05,1:04:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,威什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mega-what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.05,1:04:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的星球曾是一个强大的帝国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our planet was once a powerful empire, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.65,1:04:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,平静祥和{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}peaceful and just, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.75,1:04:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到有一天 威震天出卖了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we were betrayed by Megatron, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.75,1:04:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是霸天虎的首领{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}leader of the Decepticons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.65,1:04:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不服从他们的势力都被消灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All who defied them were destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.05,1:04:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们的星球也在战争中消逝殆尽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our war finally consumed the planet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.85,1:04:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,火种源也消失在星际之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the All Spark was lost to the stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.15,1:04:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,威震天尾随它来到地球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megatron followed it to Earth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.15,1:04:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是在那里维特维奇船长发现了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where Captain Witwicky found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.25,1:04:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的祖父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandfather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.05,1:05:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个意外 却把我们的命运纠缠在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident that intertwined our fates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.45,1:05:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.55,1:05:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,它好像找到了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the dogs have found something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.25,1:05:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰面开裂了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ice is cracking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.35,1:05:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长！抓住绳子 船长！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain! Grab my rope, Captain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.15,1:05:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 伙计们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right, lads!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.35,1:05:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要给你扔条绳子吗 船长？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we throw you a rope, Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.35,1:05:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,威震天在拿到能量体之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megatron crash-landed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.55,1:05:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠落到地球上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he could retrieve the Cube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.05,1:05:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们！我们有个重大发现！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men! We've made a discovery!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.55,1:05:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他无意中启动了它的导航系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He accidentally activated his navigation system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.55,1:06:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,能量体在地球上的座标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coordinates to the Cube's location on Earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.85,1:06:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,由此印在了他的镜片上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}were imprinted on his glasses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.45,1:06:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道眼镜的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know about his glasses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.65,1:06:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 易趣网 - 易趣网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- eBay. - eBay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.95,1:06:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果霸天虎们找到了火种源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Decepticons find the All Spark, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.25,1:06:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就会用它的能量转换…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will use its power to transform…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.75,1:06:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上的机器 建立新的军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth's machines and build a new army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.15,1:06:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,届时人类便会灭亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the human race will be extinguished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.65,1:06:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆·维特维奇 地球的存亡就掌握在你的手上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Witwicky, you hold the key to Earth's survival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.35,1:06:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼镜还在你那儿吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me that you have those glasses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.35,1:06:51.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（大西洋上空某处）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.25,1:06:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直就是个能自我修复的装甲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a self-regenerating molecular armor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.75,1:06:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看脱壳穿甲弹打的弹孔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the scorch mark where the sabot round hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.65,1:06:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,直穿而过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melted right through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.25,1:07:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿甲弹是不是可以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, aren't sabots hot-Ioaded for, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.25,1:07:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,产生6000度的高温{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, a 6, 000-degree magnesium burn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.65,1:07:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,很接近 能烧熔坦克装甲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close to it. It melts tank armor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.95,1:07:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此它的金属表面一定会在极高温下有反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this metal skin must react to extreme heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.45,1:07:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注意！- 啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heads up! - Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.25,1:07:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说这鬼东西已经死了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said that thing was dead, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.35,1:07:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,捆住它！捆住！这东西很邪门！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strap it down! Strap it! This thing is wicked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.15,1:07:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 联系北方司令部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, get on the horn with Northern Command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.55,1:07:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们我们的有效武器…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them that our effective weapon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.65,1:07:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是高温穿甲弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is high-heat sabot rounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.95,1:07:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,建议所有的直升机都配备这种弹药 去吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recommend we load them on all the gunships. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.65,1:07:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这块你要不要？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want that piece?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.45,1:07:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛吉 你听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Maggie, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.55,1:07:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你接下来会怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me break it down to you how it's gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.85,1:07:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下进来的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gonna come through that door…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.90,1:07:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有唱黑脸 有唱白脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and be good cop, bad cop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.05,1:07:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别中圈套 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fall for that, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.70,1:07:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才吃这些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I ate their food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.05,1:07:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 他们把吃的放这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, they put the plate of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.35,1:07:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是要试探你是不是心虚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}donuts out here to test your guilt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.15,1:07:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不吃 就说明你心虚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't touch it, you're guilty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.75,1:07:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我整盘都吃啦 整盘！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ate the whole plate. The whole plate. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.65,1:07:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就咱俩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me and you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.95,1:07:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们进来时 你什么也别说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They walk through that door, you don't say nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.75,1:08:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她干的！是她干的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did it! She did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.30,1:08:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她才是你们要抓的人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the one you want! All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.95,1:08:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在家看卡通片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just sitting at home watching cartoons, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.65,1:08:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有跟我堂弟玩游戏而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}playing video games with my cousin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.85,1:08:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她闯了进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she came in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.75,1:08:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后… - 格伦 你个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And then… - Glen, you freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.85,1:08:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会因为你或任何人去坐牢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I am not going to jail for you or anybody else!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.15,1:08:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子从来没干过坏事！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have done nothing bad my entire life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.50,1:08:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我还是个童男呢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, I'm still a virgin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.95,1:08:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那又怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.05,1:08:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是从互联网上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've downloaded a couple of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.85,1:08:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,下载了几千首歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}thousand songs off the Internet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.25,1:08:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是谁没有呢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who hasn't? Who hasn't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.05,1:08:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我发誓！- 格伦 闭嘴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I promise! - Glen, shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.15,1:08:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你闭嘴！不要跟我说话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you shut up! Don't talk to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.05,1:08:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要跟我说话 你这个罪犯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk to me, criminal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.25,1:08:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 给糖甜昏了头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sugar rush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.30,1:08:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不…这不是他的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is… This is not his fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.45,1:08:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗？我能回家了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? So can I go home now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.15,1:08:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 好吧 我不会了 - 但请你听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, okay. I won't. - But just listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.45,1:08:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是谁黑了你们的防卫系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, whoever hacked into your military system…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.75,1:08:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且下载了一个文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}downloaded a file, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.35,1:08:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是跟一个名叫维特维奇的人有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was something about someone named Witwicky{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.75,1:08:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个政府组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some government group, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.75,1:08:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫做第七区组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Named Sector Seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.45,1:08:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你让我先跟国防部长谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to let me talk to Defense Secretary Keller…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.25,1:08:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你们很可能跟错误的敌人作战！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you go to war with the wrong country!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.65,1:08:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管天上掉了什么 它就落在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever fell out of the sky ended up right behind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.65,1:08:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么说？- 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did he say? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.35,1:08:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he hear it, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.05,1:08:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 杰克也听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Jack heard it, too. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.85,1:09:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he think it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.85,1:09:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为是军事实验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks it's a military experiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.55,1:09:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直不知所谓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a knucklehead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.15,1:09:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我觉得是一架飞机…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I think it's a plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.35,1:09:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 目前官方尚未发布任何意见… - 耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Still no official word as to what happened. You… - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.70,1:09:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话给山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.55,1:09:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 为什么？- 15分钟之内他该到家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Why? - He should be home in 15 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.25,1:09:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我15分钟之内打电话给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll call him in 15 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.65,1:09:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你再等15分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wait 15 minutes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.65,1:09:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他就晚了 你就得要禁他的足了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll be late and you'll have to ground him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.25,1:09:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他没有晚 我就不能禁他 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't ground him if he's not late, can I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.15,1:09:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就呆在这儿 知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to stay here, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.75,1:09:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要呆在这儿看着他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to stay here and you're gonna watch them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.95,1:09:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 好的 - 所有的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, okay. - All of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.05,1:09:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白了吗？- 嗯 嗯 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you hear what I'm saying? - Yeah, okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.15,1:09:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就5分钟 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.85,1:09:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你走在了入门径上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for staying on my path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.95,1:09:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不不 爸爸…嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. No, no, Dad. Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.85,1:09:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 入门径{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The… Oh, the path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.85,1:09:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我忘记了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I forgot about the path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.95,1:09:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就打扫干净{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna sweep the whole thing right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.75,1:09:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.65,1:09:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要知道我给你买了车… - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, I buy half your car… - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.05,1:09:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你从警察局保释出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I bail you out of jail…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.55,1:09:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还打算包了你所有的家务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I just decided to do all your chores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.85,1:09:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 家务… - 对啊 生活挺不错嘛 啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The chores. - Yeah. Life is great, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.55,1:09:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活简直无与伦比 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life… Life is fantastic, is how good it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.55,1:09:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 还有垃圾筒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so… Oh, the trash cans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.35,1:09:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 爸爸 我马上去倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Dad. I'm gonna do the trash cans now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.15,1:09:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我不想累坏你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I don't want you to strain yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.35,1:09:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不会累的 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I won't strain myself, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.95,1:09:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.55,1:09:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你那样做 我会很伤心的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would hurt my feelings if you do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.55,1:09:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你肯定？我不介意… - 我保证…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure? I don't mind, I… - I promise…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.95,1:09:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 我会去做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, I'm gonna do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.35,1:10:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去倒了垃圾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do the trash cans…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.30,1:10:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会擦洗烤架{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna scrape the grill…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.35,1:10:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.35,1:10:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就去打扫整个屋子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna sweep up the whole house right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.25,1:10:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今晚 现在？- 对 现在！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tonight, right now? - Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.75,1:10:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.65,1:10:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you. God, I love you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.05,1:10:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我此时此刻真是太爱你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just so much right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.05,1:10:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈要我把你关在家呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Mom wanted me to ground you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.65,1:10:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你晚回家三分钟了 - 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're three minutes late. - Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.25,1:10:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你看 你又为我做了一件事 爸爸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, just another thing you did for me, Dad, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.15,1:10:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're such a swell guy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.65,1:10:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一件事 哈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more thing, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.95,1:10:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我爱你 睡个好觉 帅哥！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I love you! Sleep good, handsome man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.05,1:10:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛？你这是干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.35,1:10:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 注意门径 注意门径！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, watch the path! Watch the path!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.65,1:10:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意… 拜托 拜托 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the… Please, please, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.65,1:10:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 等等 不 不！- 糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, wait. No, no, no! Oh, no! - Oops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.65,1:10:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 我的错 - 啊 我…你不能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. My bad. - Oh, I… You couldn't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.15,1:10:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么连五分钟…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't wait for five…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.85,1:10:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么连五分钟都等不了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't wait for five minutes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.25,1:10:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 呆在那儿！呆在那儿！上帝！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to just stay! Just stay! God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.35,1:10:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是叫你看住他们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to watch them. I told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.65,1:10:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.45,1:10:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是这样急性子啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They seem to be in a little bit of a rush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.85,1:10:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 太糟糕了 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is bad. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.75,1:10:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔球！魔球！别靠近机器人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mojo, Mojo! Off the robot! God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.75,1:10:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 湿了 - 不 不 不 冷静 冷静！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, wet. - No, no, no, no, no! Easy! Easy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.35,1:10:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 住手！这是魔球 这是魔球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on! Hold! This is Mojo. This is Mojo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.75,1:11:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的宠物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a pet of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.25,1:11:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是宠物 明白？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a pet. Okay? That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.45,1:11:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能收起你的武器…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could just put the guns away…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.15,1:11:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,收起它们 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the… Put them away. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.35,1:11:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有只啮齿动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a rodent infestation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.25,1:11:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一只什么？- 要不要摧毁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A what? - Shall I terminate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.55,1:11:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 它不是啮齿动物 它只是吉娃娃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no. He's not a rodent, he's a Chihuahua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.75,1:11:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的吉娃娃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my… This is my Chihuahua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.05,1:11:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都爱吉娃娃 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We love Chihuahuas! Don't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.05,1:11:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他撒了我满脚润滑剂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's leaked lubricants all over my foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.25,1:11:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在你脚上撒尿？坏魔球！坏魔球！- 坏魔球！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He peed on you? Bad Mojo. Bad Mojo! - Bad Mojo!{\r}
