Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.55,1:13:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得帮帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to do something here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.55,1:13:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得帮帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to do something here.{\r}
