Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.40,1:14:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许就这么反射… - 光是从门缝里出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe it bounced… - There was light under the door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.80,1:14:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 你们不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you can't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.50,1:15:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能就这么闯进我的房间里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just bounce into my room like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.20,1:15:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该先敲门 先沟通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to knock. You got to communicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.40,1:15:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们敲了5分钟了 - 我长大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We knocked for five minutes. - I'm a teenager.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.50,1:15:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们敲门了 - 你们没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We knocked. - You didn't knock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.00,1:15:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们是在冲我喊 知道吗？- 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were screaming at me, okay? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.60,1:15:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在是在打压我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is repression, what you're doing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.10,1:15:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在蹂躏我的青春 知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ruining my youth, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.30,1:15:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 老天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for Pete's sakes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.60,1:15:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太过激了 你在手淫吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so defensive! Were you masturbating?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.90,1:15:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 茱蒂 - 我在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Judy. - Was I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.10,1:15:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 老妈 - 够了 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Mom. - Zip it, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.10,1:15:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没关系的 - 没有 我没有手淫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. - No, I don't masturbate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.60,1:15:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你该管的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not something for you to bring up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.70,1:15:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是父子间的对话 好不好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a father-and-son thing, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.60,1:15:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,父与子的私事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father-son thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.30,1:15:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 如果你不喜欢…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you don't have to call it that word…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.00,1:15:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个词的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if that makes you uncomfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.30,1:15:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以称它为“山姆的快乐时间”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can call it Sam's happy time or…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.00,1:15:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快乐时间？- 或“我特别的…”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Happy time? - my special alone time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.10,1:15:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说了 - 老妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop. - Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.20,1:15:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 茱蒂 别说了 - “私人时间”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Judy, stop. - with myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.30,1:15:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老妈 你不能就这么进来 - 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom, you can't come in and… - I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.40,1:15:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚有点不自在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just been a weird night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.55,1:15:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我稍微喝了点酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a little bit to drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.80,1:15:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 老爸 - 好了 我们的确看到光的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, Dad. - Yeah, well, we saw a light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.00,1:15:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 父母来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.60,1:15:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道在哪儿 但我的确看到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where it was, but we saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.60,1:15:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,地震！又来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earthquake! It's another one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.40,1:15:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是地震！回到走廊里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another earthquake! Get in the doorway!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.20,1:15:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的！- 余震！余震！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay! - Aftershock! Aftershock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.00,1:15:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我不喜欢地震{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I hate these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.10,1:15:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安全第一 安全第一！- 快 藏起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got to ride it out. Ride it out! - Quick, hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.40,1:15:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 来电了 - 藏起来？什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, the lights are back on. - Hide? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.60,1:15:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 藏哪儿？- 拜托 从浴缸里出来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Come on, get out of that tub.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.20,1:15:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得保命很重要的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you take safety seriously?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.60,1:16:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要命 这地板真脏 山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Lord, this floor is filthy, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.40,1:16:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不！你看院子 都毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Look at the yard. The yard is destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.00,1:16:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱蒂 打给电力局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judy? Better call the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.75,1:16:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,变压器好像爆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a blown transformer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.60,1:16:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,电杆火星四射！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power pole's sparking all over the place!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.20,1:16:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 院子被毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. Yard's a waste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.60,1:16:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一塌糊涂 完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trashed. Gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.60,1:16:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 成洼地了 整个花园 - 你开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a wash. The whole yard. - You're kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.10,1:16:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对父母很烦人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The parents are very irritating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.30,1:16:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 是啊 - 我能不能处理掉他们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, yeah, yeah. - Can I take them out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.10,1:16:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁皮 你知道我们不能伤害人类的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ironhide, you know we don't harm humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.90,1:16:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.20,1:16:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说我们是可以 只是一个方案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm just saying we could. It's an option.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.60,1:16:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听到你和别人在说话 山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We heard you talking to somebody, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.40,1:16:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底是谁？- 老妈 我说了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We wanna know who. - Mom, I told…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.90,1:16:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是梅卡拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I'm Mikaela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.50,1:16:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是山姆的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a… I'm a friend of Sam's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.20,1:16:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你真漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosh, you're gorgeous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.90,1:16:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真是美若天仙 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that the prettiest girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.60,1:16:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她听得到你说话 妈 - 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She can hear you talking, Mom. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.00,1:16:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！真抱歉让你听到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my goodness. I'm sorry you had to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.55,1:16:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的家庭讨论…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hear our little family discussion about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.20,1:16:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉打扰你们了 - 妈 我的背包呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry that we're bugging you. - Do you have my backpack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.80,1:16:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 亲爱的 我们走 - 哦 在厨房里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, hon. Let's go. - Oh, it's in the kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.30,1:17:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.80,1:17:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈人真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom's so nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.90,1:17:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我分散我父母的注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to distract my parents while…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.00,1:17:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能溜出去把眼镜交给他们 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I slip out and get these glasses to them, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.20,1:17:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗纳德·维奇提？- 是维特维奇 你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ronald Wickity? - It's Witwicky. Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.80,1:17:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是政府机关 第七区的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the government. Sector Seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.00,1:17:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从来没听过 - 以后也不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Never heard of it. - Never will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.20,1:17:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son's the great-grandson…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.20,1:17:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿奇巴尔德·维奇提的曾孙子 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Captain Archibald Wickity, is he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.80,1:17:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是维特维奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Witwicky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.10,1:17:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能进屋吗 先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I enter the premises, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.40,1:17:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣恩 前院有好多人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron, there's guys all over the front yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.40,1:17:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the heck is going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.50,1:17:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子昨晚举报有人偷车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son filed a stolen car report last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.80,1:17:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为这关系到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think it's involved in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.90,1:17:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,国家的安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a national security matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.10,1:17:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在拔我的玫瑰！- 国家安全？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're ripping up my rose bushes! - National security?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.70,1:17:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 国家安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. National security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.80,1:17:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 荣恩 到处都是他们的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, Ron, they're everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.50,1:17:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是穿西装的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's guys in suits all around the house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.00,1:17:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.00,1:17:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不可以别踩我的草坪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you stay off the grass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.90,1:18:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我采取一些同位素的样本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me a sample and some isotope readings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.40,1:18:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把树都拔了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're pulling bushes out of the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.20,1:18:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Lord!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.50,1:18:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许他们碰我的花！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got to get their hands off my bush!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.50,1:18:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请放下你的球棒 女士 - 喂喂喂 那是我的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drop the bat, ma'am. - Hey, hey, hey, that's my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.10,1:18:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是带着武器的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm carrying a loaded weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.50,1:18:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好叫你的人离开我的花园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'd better get those guys out of my garden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.90,1:18:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我会狠狠修理他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I am gonna beat the crap out of them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.20,1:18:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否有流感的症状？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you experiencing any flu-like symptoms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.20,1:18:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,关节疼痛 发烧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aching joints? Fever?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.30,1:18:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.50,1:18:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好呀 小子 你叫山姆吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, son? Is your name Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.40,1:18:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 那你得跟我们走一趟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Well, I need you to come with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.90,1:18:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 那可不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, way out of line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.30,1:18:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我这已经很客气了 退下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I am asking politely. Back off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.40,1:18:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能带我儿子走 - 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not taking my son. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.40,1:18:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,想和我们硬碰硬？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna try to get rough with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.60,1:18:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 但我会打电话报警 只因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I'm gonna call the cops because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.00,1:18:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事太点蹊跷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's something fishy going on around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.20,1:18:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这里是有些不对劲 你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. There's something a little fishy about you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.70,1:18:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子 还有扣皮带的狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your son, your little Taco Bell dog…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.50,1:18:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个组织都有蹊跷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this whole operation you got going on here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.00,1:18:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么组织？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What operation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.80,1:18:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接下来就知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is what we are gonna find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.40,1:18:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为是直接接触{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think direct contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.40,1:18:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孩子 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Son? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.00,1:18:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请上前来 - 站着就行？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Step forward, please. - Just stand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.70,1:19:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,14单位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fourteen rads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.80,1:19:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,找对人了！把他们贴上标签卷走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo! Tag them and bag them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.00,1:19:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢伤我的狗 我就揣你屁股{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hurt my dog, I'll kick your ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.00,1:19:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尽快取得植被上的样本 - 山姆…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get me a sample on that vegetation ASAP! - Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.80,1:19:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要开口 山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not say anything, Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.40,1:19:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 在律师来前一个字都别说！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Not a word until we get a lawyer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.50,1:19:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.10,1:19:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,万人迷先生217{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}LadiesMan217…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.70,1:19:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的易趣帐号名称 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is your eBay username, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.30,1:19:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我打错字了 不过就将错就错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, you know, it was a typo and I ran with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.70,1:19:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.80,1:19:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫山姆·维特维奇 知道吗？我的车…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Sam Witwicky, okay? And my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.40,1:19:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.70,1:19:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 那听起来像万人迷先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that sounds like LadiesMan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.00,1:19:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚在警局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night at the station, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.40,1:19:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你的车变形了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you told the officer your car transformed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.10,1:19:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能解释一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enlighten me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.00,1:19:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听我说 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here's what I said, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.60,1:19:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我车被偷的这一切…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause this is a total misunderstanding…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.30,1:19:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是个误会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my car had been stolen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.10,1:19:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 从我手上 从家里…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - from me, from my home, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.40,1:19:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在没事了 因为它回来了 已经回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's fine now because it's back! It came back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.40,1:20:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是自己回来的 - 当然不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, not by itself. - Well, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.30,1:20:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为车子不会自己回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because cars don't do that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.70,1:20:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那太荒唐了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because that would be crazy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.90,1:20:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好笑 好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny. That is so funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.60,1:20:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个对外星人了解多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you kids know about aliens, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.20,1:20:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说火星人？ET？不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean, like a Martian? Like what, E. T? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.10,1:20:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那只是个传说 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's an urban legend. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.70,1:20:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道这是什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.90,1:20:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一枚…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.50,1:20:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,“为所欲为”徽章{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-can-do-whatever-I-want and-get-away-with-it badge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.60,1:20:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 - 我要把你们永远关起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - I'm gonna lock you up forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.50,1:20:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 老天 我告诉你 别听他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. You know what? Don't listen to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.80,1:20:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他生气是因为他回去后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just pissy 'cause he's got to get back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.50,1:20:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得去作购物中心的保安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to guarding the mall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.30,1:20:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这穿着运动胸罩的 别惹我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, in the training bra, do not test me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.50,1:20:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其你爸的假释期快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially with your daddy's parole coming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.70,1:20:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？假释期？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Parole?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.20,1:20:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.20,1:20:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 偷车大盗不算什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, grand theft auto, that ain't nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.70,1:20:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我爸以前教我修的车…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know those cars my dad used to teach me to fix?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.80,1:20:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些…不全是他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they… They weren't always his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.60,1:20:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们偷车？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stole cars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.80,1:20:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有时请不起保姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we couldn't always afford a babysitter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.60,1:20:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时他就会带我一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so sometimes he had to take me along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.50,1:20:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也有少年犯罪前科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got her own juvie record to prove it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.90,1:20:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个罪犯！性感的罪犯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a criminal. Criminals are hot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.70,1:20:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不合作而让他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd be a real shame if he had to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.10,1:20:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,下半辈子待在监狱不太好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}rot in jail the rest of his natural life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.40,1:20:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,该说实话了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time to talk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.50,1:21:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的好大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big! It's big!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.60,1:21:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.00,1:21:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到！我看不到！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see it! I can't see it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.50,1:21:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把重心朝前！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shift your weight towards the front!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.80,1:21:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了！够了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.80,1:21:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群废柴有麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You A-holes are in trouble now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.20,1:21:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 让我向你们介绍 我的朋友…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, I want to introduce you to my friend, {\r}
