Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.00,1:21:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走这些孩子是错误的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking the children was a bad move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.80,1:21:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽车人 卸下他们的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Autobots, relieve them of their weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.80,1:21:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.50,1:21:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me those!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.10,1:22:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.70,1:22:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像不怕我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't seem afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.05,1:22:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你们看到我们不觉得惊讶吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you not surprised to see us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.10,1:22:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,第七区有规定 知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there are S-Seven protocols, okay?{\r}
