Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.10,1:22:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过除了告诉你“我不能和你交流”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}except to tell you I can't communicate with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.40,1:22:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下车 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of the car. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.60,1:22:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我？你要我… - 下车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me? You want me to get… - Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.90,1:22:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的好的 下车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right. Get out. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.50,1:22:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我…我在下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm… I'm getting out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.15,1:22:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下了 看到没？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting out. You see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.90,1:22:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,能那么放下我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nifty how you put us down…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.65,1:22:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不让我们受伤 不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}without really killing us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.50,1:22:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对手铐也很在行吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good with handcuffs, too, now, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.20,1:22:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.30,1:22:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该知道那些的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't supposed to hear all that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.10,1:22:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 这都是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - This is real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.40,1:22:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 如果我准备和他开战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen. If I choose to engage with him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.00,1:22:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,“妈妈”就是密语 知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}mum is the word, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.70,1:22:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 我那前科是因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I have a record because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.55,1:22:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不肯供出我爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't turn my dad in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.00,1:22:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你完美的人生里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When have you had to sacrifice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.50,1:23:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有过不得不作出牺牲的时候吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything in your perfect little life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.80,1:23:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家伙 拿大炮的大家伙 嗯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big guys. Big guys with big guns, huh?{\r}
