Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.50,1:23:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你碰我的话会触了联邦法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You touch me, that's a federal offense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.50,1:23:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为所欲为的徽章 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do-whatever-you-want and-get-away-with-it badge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.40,1:23:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在有这些…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Brave now all of a sudden, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.40,1:23:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人做靠山就大胆起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with his big alien friend standing over there.{\r}
