Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.50,1:23:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不想知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you like to know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.80,1:23:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.80,1:23:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大黄蜂 停止润滑他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bumblebee, stop lubricating the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.90,1:23:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了 好不好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that thing to stop, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.30,1:23:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 猛男 开始脱吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, tough guy, take it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.95,1:23:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.70,1:23:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的衣服 全脱了 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your clothes, all of it, off. - For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.60,1:23:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你威胁我爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For threatening my dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.50,1:23:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姑娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little lady, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.60,1:23:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你生命终结的序曲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is the beginning of the end of your life.{\r}
