Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.50,1:24:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对现实吧 上梁不正下梁歪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's face facts. It's in your gene pool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.80,1:24:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错啊 站到路灯后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are nice. Now get behind the pole.{\r}
