Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.80,1:24:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这样做犯了很严重的罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is such a felony, what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.00,1:24:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会抓到你的 - 他抓到你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will hunt you down, okay? - He'll hunt you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.00,1:24:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会心软的 - 不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Without any remorse! - No remorse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.30,1:24:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呆这吧 - 好了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Enjoy. - Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.60,1:24:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须通知所有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have got to alert everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.85,1:24:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经知道了 扩音器模式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They already know. Speaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.60,1:24:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,擎天柱！敌人入侵！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Optimus! Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.30,1:24:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roll out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.40,1:24:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那桥下测出…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm picking up rad readings…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.05,1:24:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有辐射反映{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}under that bridge right down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.60,1:24:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,辐射反映很强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm getting really good rad readings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.50,1:24:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过42个单位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forty-two and higher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.10,1:24:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up you get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.20,1:25:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们要行动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're dropping in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.20,1:25:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们下方辐射指数很高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really strong readings right down below us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.80,1:25:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.90,1:25:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,1号和2号船 到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ship one and two, come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.10,1:25:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了 在那儿 锁定他 锁定他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, right there. Mark him, mark him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.80,1:25:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那儿 正前方偏左 正下方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, there he is. 11:30. Right off the nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.60,1:25:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了 正前方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. 12:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.30,1:25:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我在跟踪她 找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm tracking him. I've got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.70,1:25:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正沿着街道移动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got him going down the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.50,1:25:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪儿了？我找不到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Where'd he go, guys? I lost him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.80,1:25:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去红外信号 他去哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got no IR signature. Where'd he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.40,1:25:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号丢失 信号丢失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I lost him. I lost him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.10,1:25:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这就赶过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're coming around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.80,1:26:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 你们俩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.00,1:26:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！山姆！山姆！别放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No, Sam! Sam, don't drop me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.60,1:26:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 不要！我在往下滑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, don't! Sam, don't! I'm slipping! I'm slipping!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.90,1:26:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住！- 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.60,1:26:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.50,1:26:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we've got him pinned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.05,1:26:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标锁定在河上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got him pinned in the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.70,1:26:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入射击范围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in for the shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.10,1:26:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！住手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.70,1:26:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.90,1:26:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 射击 抓住他 - 射击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take the shot, get him. - Take the shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.10,1:26:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.40,1:27:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！住手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.10,1:27:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.00,1:27:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴在地上！趴下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down on the ground! Get down! Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.40,1:27:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.60,1:27:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 他没有还手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he's not fighting back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.40,1:27:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,冻住它！冻住它！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze it! Freeze it! Freeze it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.90,1:27:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要伤害他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop hurting him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.90,1:27:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他别动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.40,1:27:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.10,1:28:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.20,1:28:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到我开不开心？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy to see me again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.50,1:28:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他和他的罪犯朋友关到车子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him in a car with his little criminal friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.10,1:28:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那东西冷冻起来准备运送{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that thing frozen and ready for transport!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.30,1:28:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 我去侦查一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang back. Let me check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.40,1:28:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Optimus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.20,1:28:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就待在这儿什么都不做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are we just gonna stand here and do nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.80,1:28:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没办法为救大黄蜂…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way to free Bumblebee…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.60,1:28:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不伤害人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}without harming the humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.60,1:29:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但这成何体统 他… - 让他们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it's not right. He… - Let them leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.40,1:29:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国和俄国 非常接近我们的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Chinese and the Russians are nearing our{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.50,1:29:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,西太平洋作战区 这局势…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}area of operations in the western Pacific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.80,1:29:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们控制不了多久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We feel like this could get out of hand real fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.40,1:29:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来数小时…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the next couple of hours…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.75,1:29:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就看他们总统怎么做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}may just define his presidency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.50,1:29:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有中国特遣舰队已经接近…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}US and Chinese task forces approaching…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.50,1:29:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,巡弋飞弹射程100英里之内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}100 nautical miles of cruise missile range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.90,1:29:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉航母指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the strike group commander…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.20,1:29:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非对方先进攻 否则不要攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he's not to engage unless fired on first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.50,1:29:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 长官 - 部长先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir! - Mr. Secretary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.90,1:29:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是汤姆·班奈杰克 隶属第七区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom Banachek. I'm with Sector Seven, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.80,1:29:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,先进研究部的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advanced Research Division.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.10,1:29:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没听说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never heard of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.10,1:29:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在很忙 汤姆 我想你也看得出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little busy, Tom. I think you can see that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.40,1:29:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？- 不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on here? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.50,1:30:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况通报员！出来说句话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit rep! Talk to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.30,1:30:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,整间作业都中断了 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole room's gone down, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.70,1:30:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得出来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.80,1:30:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒是用来中断所有作业的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The virus was coded to shut us down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.60,1:30:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 将军？- 我坐在那里等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- General? - I'll take a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.10,1:30:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,中止作业是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "shut us down"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.10,1:30:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们利用我们网站{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They used our network…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.10,1:30:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,把病毒散布出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to spread out to the whole world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.20,1:30:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球性的网络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blackout's global.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.40,1:30:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们与全球的卫星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no communications, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.40,1:30:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,固网联络都中断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}satellite and land lines are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.40,1:30:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我无法用这台电话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean to tell me that I cannot pick up this telephone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.99,1:30:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给我家里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and call my family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.80,1:30:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Secretary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.00,1:30:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是奉总统之命而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here under direct order from the President.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.20,1:30:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要看看我这手提箱里的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really need to see what I have in the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.60,1:30:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须知道有些事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to accept that there are certain things{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.30,1:30:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法立即了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't understand right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.50,1:30:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,第七区是政府内…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sector Seven is a special-access…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.30,1:30:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个特殊部门 它的成立…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}division of the government, convened in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.30,1:30:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是80年前奉胡佛总统之密令成立的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}secret under President Hoover 80 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.20,1:30:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,您可能记得太空总署和喷推实验室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may remember NASA JPL…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.20,1:30:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在火星上损失了猎犬二号机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lost the Beagle 2 Mars Rover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.40,1:30:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们告诉他们将整件任务…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We told them to report the mission…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.00,1:30:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣告失败 其实不然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a complete failure. It wasn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.10,1:31:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎犬二号传输了十三秒钟的影像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beagle 2 transmitted 13 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.10,1:31:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是比最高机密还要机密的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was classified above top secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.60,1:31:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,电子活动在170小时48分后停止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}EDA ended at 170 hours, 48 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.40,1:31:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,火星上不是只有石头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than just a pile of Martian rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.30,1:31:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是火星上传来的影像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the image from Mars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.20,1:31:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是您的特种部队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the image your Special Ops team{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.50,1:31:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在基地被袭击时拍得的影像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was able to retrieve from the base attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.60,1:31:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信这是相同的外骨骼结构{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe they are of the same exoskeletal type, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.60,1:31:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然地并非俄国或北朝鲜能有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and obviously not Russian or North Korean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.80,1:31:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说外星入侵？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we talking about an invasion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.50,1:31:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拦劫了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We intercepted the message…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.05,1:31:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,特种部队传来的讯息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from your Special Ops team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.70,1:31:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些东西知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things can be hurt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.00,1:31:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也能被我方武器损伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by our weapons and now they know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.20,1:31:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们用病毒使军事指挥陷入瘫痪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why the virus shut us down, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.00,1:31:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我们无法组织防备他们下一波攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we can't coordinate against their next attack, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.40,1:31:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢用我的政府薪金打赌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I would bet my ridiculous…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.65,1:32:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一波攻击绝对会很快来临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}government salary is coming soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.80,1:32:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,用国民警卫队的频道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get word to our fleet commanders…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.95,1:32:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知舰队指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the National Guard frequency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.20,1:32:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是短波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a shortwave radio channel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.90,1:32:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能还有作用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be still working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.70,1:32:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他们调转船头 迅速赶回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them to turn their ships around and come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.20,1:32:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知各司令部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And inform all commands…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.65,1:32:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵抗即将发生的攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to prepare for imminent attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.30,1:32:22.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（内利斯空军基地）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.30,1:32:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦诺克斯上尉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Lennox, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.50,1:32:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,请带你的部队跟我们来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need you and your team to come with us right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.70,1:32:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.70,1:32:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.60,1:32:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.80,1:32:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.00,1:32:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来做我的顾问 - 我也要去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're going to be my advisor. - Me, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.80,1:32:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.90,1:32:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是我的顾问 - 那他也来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's my advisor. - He comes, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.20,1:33:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么… - 他们要你们来做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So… - What'd they get you for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.80,1:33:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我买了辆车…结果是个外星机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bought a car. Turned out to be an alien robot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.80,1:33:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.70,1:33:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走直线！小心你身后！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a hole! Watch your back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.40,1:33:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 希望有用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, let this work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.60,1:33:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动吧 擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire it up, Optimus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.40,1:33:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,代码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.00,1:33:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼镜里的代码显示…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The code on these glasses indicates…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.75,1:33:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,火种源在离这里230英里远处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the All Spark is 230 miles from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.30,1:34:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到霸天虎…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sense the Decepticons…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.00,1:34:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,已准备开始行动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are getting ready to mobilize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.20,1:34:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定也知道火种源在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must know it's here, as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.10,1:34:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大黄蜂怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Bumblebee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.50,1:34:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能就这么失去他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just leave him to die…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.50,1:34:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睁睁的被人类当作试验品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and become some human experiment!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.70,1:34:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不完成任务的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll die in vain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.20,1:34:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的牺牲就白费了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we don't accomplish our mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.80,1:34:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大黄峰是名勇敢的战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bumblebee is a brave soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.10,1:34:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会是他所希望的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what he would want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.10,1:34:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何我们为拯救人类而战？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we fighting to save the humans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.50,1:34:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是个原始且残暴的种族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a primitive and violent race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.20,1:34:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前不也是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were we so different?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.10,1:34:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是个年轻的种族 还有很多要学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a young species. They have much to learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.60,1:34:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我看到过他们的优点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've seen goodness in them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.50,1:34:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由是所有有情感的生物之希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freedom is the right of all sentient beings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.70,1:34:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都知道结束这战争只有一个方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all know there's only one way to end this war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.10,1:34:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须消灭能量体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must destroy the Cube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.60,1:34:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果其它方法都失败的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If all else fails, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.60,1:34:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会将它与我胸中之火光结合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will unite it with the spark in my chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.20,1:34:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是自杀行为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.70,1:35:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,能量体的能源非常不稳定 可能会玉石俱焚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cube is raw power. It could destroy you both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.60,1:35:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这星球的和平 牺牲是难免的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A necessary sacrifice to bring peace to this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.20,1:35:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让人类为我们的错误而偿命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot let the humans pay for our mistakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.90,1:35:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸与你们共战至今{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been an honor serving with you all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.70,1:35:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 汽车人 出发！- 出发！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Autobots, roll out! - We rolling!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.60,1:35:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,立正！敬礼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team attention! Present arms!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.40,1:35:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 军士 请稍息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At ease. Captain, Sergeant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.60,1:35:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到你的情报了 干得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got your intel. Excellent work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.80,1:35:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 炮艇机呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir. What about the gunships?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.60,1:35:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有炮艇机上加装了脱壳穿甲弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're being retrofitted with sabot rounds now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.80,1:35:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们再来袭击 没问题的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they hit us again, we'll be ready for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.20,1:35:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不恢复全球的通讯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it won't do us much good…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.60,1:35:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可真是不太妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we can't get world communications back up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.80,1:35:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.10,1:35:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们之前有点误会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we got off to a bad start, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.30,1:35:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定饿了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.50,1:35:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要来杯拿铁咖啡 或者2份超大的玛琪朵咖啡如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a latte? HoHo? Double venti macchiato?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.60,1:36:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.30,1:36:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 你仔细听好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, I need you to listen to me very carefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.40,1:36:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里人们的生命有危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People can die here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.40,1:36:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须马上告诉我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to know everything you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.90,1:36:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to know it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.30,1:36:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.60,1:36:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得先把我的车和我父母还我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, I'll take my car, my parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.60,1:36:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部要书面保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should write that down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.40,1:36:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 还有她的少年前科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and her juvie record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.20,1:36:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也必须取消 永久地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's got to be gone. Like, forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.70,1:36:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 我们谈谈你的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me. We'll talk about your car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.80,1:36:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.60,1:36:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小子简直是勒索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man's an extortionist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.00,1:36:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here's the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.50,1:36:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都曾直接接触过NBEs{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've all had direct contact with the NBEs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.00,1:36:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,NBEs？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}NBEs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.20,1:36:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,“非生物类外星人”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Non-Biological Extraterrestrials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.00,1:36:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,记清楚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and keep up with the acronyms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.90,1:36:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们即将看到的是高度机密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're about to see is totally classified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.70,1:36:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear God. What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.10,1:36:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.30,1:36:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他飞越北极时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he made his approach over the north pole, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.50,1:37:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球的地心引力扰乱了他的导航系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our gravitational field screwed up his telemetry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.00,1:37:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他坠落到冰里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He crashed in the ice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.70,1:37:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是几千年前的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably a few thousand years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.10,1:37:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在1934年将它运送到这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shipped him here to this facility in 1934.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.50,1:37:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们称它为NBE-1{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call him NBE One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.00,1:37:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生 我不是想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sir, I don't mean to correct you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.40,1:37:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,故意纠正你的错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on everything you think you know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.50,1:37:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是威震天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, I mean, that's Megatron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.10,1:37:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是霸天虎的领袖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the leader of the Decepticons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.10,1:37:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它自从1935年就处在冰冻状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been in cryostasis since 1935.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.50,1:37:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的曾曾祖父发现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your great-great-grandfather made one of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.10,1:37:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类史上最大的发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the greatest discoveries in the history of mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.80,1:37:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 你所看到的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fact is, you're looking at…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.25,1:37:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现代化的来源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the source of the modern age, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.80,1:37:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,微晶片 雷射 太空飞行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the microchip, lasers, spaceflight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.25,1:37:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽车…都是对它进行逆向工程所习得的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}cars, all reverse-engineered by studying him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.80,1:37:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,NBE-1 那是我们对它的称呼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}NBE One. That's what we call it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.20,1:37:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't think the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.20,1:37:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国军方需要知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}United States military might need to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.90,1:37:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把一个外星机器人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're keeping a hostile…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.10,1:37:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰冻在地下室？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}alien robot frozen in the basement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.40,1:37:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在最近发生的事之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until these events, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.50,1:37:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不认为它会对国家安全产生威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we had no credible threat to national security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.50,1:37:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在问题可大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got one now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.30,1:37:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但为何要来地球？- 因为火种源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So why Earth? - It's the All Spark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.80,1:37:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,火种源？那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Spark? What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.40,1:38:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在找一个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, they came here looking for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.60,1:38:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,立方体似的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}some sort of cube-Iooking thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.10,1:38:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,NBE-1 也就是威震天先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, Mr. NBE One here, AKA Megatron, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.70,1:38:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们这样称呼他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what they call him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.90,1:38:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是死亡的使者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's pretty much the harbinger of death, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.15,1:38:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,想利用能量体转化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}wants to use the Cube to transform…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.60,1:38:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类科技来统治宇宙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}human technology to take over the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.70,1:38:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是他们的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's their plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.30,1:38:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你很确定？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you're sure about that? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.10,1:38:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道那东西在哪里 是不是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys know where it is, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.80,1:38:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.50,1:38:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们将看到的东西是终极至宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're about to see our crown jewel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.00,1:38:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,碳-14年代测定预估能量体 是在公元前一万年来到地球的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carbon dating puts the Cube here around 10, 000 BC.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.50,1:38:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,七元老在1913年才发现它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first Seven didn't find it until 1913.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.90,1:38:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道这是外星物体 是因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew it was alien because of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.10,1:38:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它表面的烙画{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the matching hieroglyphics on the Cube{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.50,1:38:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和NBE-1表面的烙画非常相似{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as NBE One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.50,1:38:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡佛总统因此建造了水坝将它隐藏于其中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}President Hoover had the dam built around it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.20,1:38:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个足球场厚度的水泥…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four football fields thick of concrete{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.70,1:39:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人或外面的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A perfect way to hide its energy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.35,1:39:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何外星种族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from being detected by anyone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.10,1:39:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,都无法侦测出它所散发的能量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or any alien species on the outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.40,1:39:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,火种源位置确定{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.50,1:39:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是红蜘蛛 所有霸天虎 准备行动{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.30,1:39:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,路障上路{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.20,1:39:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,吵闹报到…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.30,1:39:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击出发…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.80,1:39:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,眩晕入列…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.20,1:39:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,威震天万岁！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.50,1:39:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, back up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.40,1:39:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说水坝隐藏了他的能量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said the dam hides the Cube's energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.90,1:39:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪种能量？- 问得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What kind exactly? - Good question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.00,1:39:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进来 他们要把我们锁在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please step inside. They have to lock us in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.80,1:40:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.60,1:40:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.30,1:40:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛瑞迪来过这里吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy Krueger done been up in here or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.70,1:40:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.00,1:40:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛瑞迪有四根爪子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy Krueger have four blades, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.60,1:40:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只有三根 那是金刚狼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's only three. That's Wolverine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.60,1:40:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不对？那是金刚狼 - 很好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right? That's Wolverine! - That's very funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.10,1:40:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有电子产品？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody have any mechanical devices?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.60,1:40:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑莓？车钥匙？手机？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}BlackBerry? Key alarm? Cell phone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.20,1:40:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个手机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.90,1:40:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺基亚真是酷毙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nokias are real nasty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.60,1:40:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要佩服日本人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to respect the Japanese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.80,1:40:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将武士道发挥地淋漓尽至{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know the way of the samurai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.80,1:40:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺基亚是芬兰做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nokia's from Finland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.00,1:40:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但他…有点奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but he's, you know, a little strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.40,1:40:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a little strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.40,1:40:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把能量体的能源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're able to take the Cube radiation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.60,1:40:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,传送到这箱子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and funnel it into that box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.60,1:41:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好凶的小东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mean little sucker, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.25,1:41:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可怕！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing is freaky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.00,1:41:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像劲量的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like the itty-bitty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.50,1:41:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,兔宝宝一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Energizer Bunny from hell, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.70,1:41:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它快把箱子打破了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's breaking the box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.60,1:41:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动！行动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.80,1:41:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.40,1:41:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 他们知道能量体在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, they know the Cube is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.80,1:41:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,班奈杰克 发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banachek. What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.30,1:41:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,NBE-1停机棚断电了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the NBE One hangar has lost power…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.20,1:42:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 备用发电机…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - and the backup generator…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.40,1:42:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法产生足够电量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is just not gonna cut it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.35,1:42:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有军火库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have an arms room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.80,1:42:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,威震天！威震天！威震天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megatron! Megatron! Megatron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.60,1:42:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上保安人员…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring security to the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.10,1:42:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有人派去NBE-1停机棚！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get everyone to the NBE One chamber now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.80,1:42:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 灯灭了！- 行动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The lights are out! - Move it! Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.50,1:42:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.90,1:42:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在攻击我们的发电机！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're popping our generators!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.20,1:42:27.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（冷冻失效）
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.80,1:42:31.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（表面温度）
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.70,1:42:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,威震天冰在融化！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megatron melting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.70,1:42:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,16502 我们在失压{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}16502. We're losing pressure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.90,1:42:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,各就各位！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by! Set!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.20,1:42:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,失压…失压{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're losing pressure!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.40,1:42:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷冻系统失常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cryogenic system is failing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.00,1:42:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去NBE-1了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're losing NBE One!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.50,1:42:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,40毫米穿甲弹在那桌上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forty millimeter sabot rounds on that table!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.90,1:43:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须带我去我的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to take me to my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.20,1:43:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须带我去我的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to take me to my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.60,1:43:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它知道怎么处理能量体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna know what to do with the Cube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.70,1:43:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的车？被没收了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your car? It's confiscated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.80,1:43:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别没收它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then unconfiscate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.80,1:43:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道让它接近能源体…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not know what will happen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.65,1:43:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,会发生什么事！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we let it near this thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.60,1:43:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.10,1:43:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你知道 但我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you know, but I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.00,1:43:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就准备呆在这儿…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just wanna sit here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.75,1:43:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐以待毙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wait and see what happens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.50,1:43:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人的生命掌握在我们手上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have people's lives at stake here, young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.60,1:43:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他去见他的车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him to his car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.00,1:43:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.00,1:43:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！喔！喔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.90,1:43:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下你的武器 军人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapon, soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.40,1:43:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人已经发动战争了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an alien war going on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.30,1:43:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却要杀我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're gonna shoot me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.30,1:43:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没必要杀你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we didn't ask to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.40,1:43:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以第七区的权力…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ordering you under S-Seven…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.50,1:43:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,命令你放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}executive jurisdiction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.70,1:43:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,第七区并不存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-Seven don't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.00,1:43:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会听命于…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. And we don't take orders…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.85,1:43:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个不存在的组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from people that don't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.80,1:43:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数到五{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna count to five. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.00,1:43:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数到三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm gonna count to three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.70,1:43:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 西门斯？- 是 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Simmons? - Yes, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.40,1:43:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会照他说的做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd do what he says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.90,1:43:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,输不是他们这些人的选项{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing's really not an option for these guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.00,1:43:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.10,1:43:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想把世界的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you want to lay the fate of the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.40,1:43:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给这小子的车 那好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the kid's Camaro? That's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.20,1:44:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！住手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.40,1:44:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！住手！住手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! You got to stop! Stop! Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.20,1:44:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！住手！住手！放开他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, stop, stop, stop! Let him go! Let him go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.90,1:44:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.20,1:44:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没伤你吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't hurt you, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.10,1:44:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 能量体在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. The Cube is here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.70,1:44:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,霸天虎已经来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Decepticons are coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.30,1:44:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 别管他们 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't worry about them. They're okay. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.50,1:44:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会伤你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gonna hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.80,1:44:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后一点 他没有恶意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just back up a little bit. He's friendly. He's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.40,1:44:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.40,1:44:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪 他们不会伤害你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the guns down. They're not gonna hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.80,1:44:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.55,1:44:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你去看火种源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take you to the All Spark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.40,1:45:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀 来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.50,1:45:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要做什么了 他要做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doing something. He doing something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.00,1:45:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.10,1:45:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自太空舰队的消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Message from Starfleet, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.60,1:45:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.10,1:45:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的对 我们要是留下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right. We stay here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.30,1:45:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就死定了 威震天就在隔壁的机棚里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're screwed with Megatron in the other hangar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.30,1:45:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近的城市在22英里外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mission City is 22 miles away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.80,1:45:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把能量体偷带出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna sneak that Cube out of here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.20,1:45:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后藏在城市里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna hide it somewhere in the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.70,1:45:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 就这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good! Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.70,1:45:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们需要空军的帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we cannot make a stand without the Air Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.60,1:45:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方一定有无线电装置吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place must have some kind of radio link!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.70,1:45:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 短波 - 对 有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Shortwave, CB. - Right, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.70,1:45:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你一定要想办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you got to figure out some way…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.00,1:45:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,传递消息出去 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get word out to them. Let's move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.40,1:45:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是非常旧的仪器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the alien archive, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.00,1:46:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前陆军使用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an old Army radio console.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.10,1:46:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还能用吗？- 一切皆有可能！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will it work? - Anything's possible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.70,1:46:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.70,1:46:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 山姆 上车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Sam, get it in the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.20,1:46:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长先生 请继续试着联络空军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Secretary! Get our birds in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.10,1:46:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们到了城市我们再找个无线电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we get to the city, we're gonna find a radio, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.80,1:46:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让艾普斯无线电导引 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll have Epps vector them in, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.90,1:46:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Affirmative!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.50,1:46:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 NBE-1冷冻系统故障{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning! NBE One cryo-containment failing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.40,1:46:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查备用系统！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check that backup system!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.60,1:46:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点逃出这里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.20,1:46:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬头！小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up! Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.70,1:46:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家帮黄车开一条路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set a perimeter around the yellow vehicle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.30,1:46:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边！这边！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, this way, this way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.00,1:46:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那！走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up there! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.40,1:46:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是威震天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Megatron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.30,1:47:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能量体没事吧？- 嗯 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Cube's okay? - Yeah, it's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.80,1:47:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,系上安全带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, put the seat belt on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.90,1:47:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄到他身上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pour it on him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.80,1:47:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸为您效劳 威震天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live to serve you, Lord Megatron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.90,1:47:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,能量体呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the Cube?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.40,1:47:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,被人类拿走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The humans have taken it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.80,1:47:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又让我失望了 红蜘蛛 抓住他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fail me yet again, Starscream. Get them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.20,1:47:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Mags!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.70,1:47:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这边 先生！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.60,1:47:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a minute. Give me a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.70,1:47:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 拜托 插在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to me, Maxwell, come to me. Plugged in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.10,1:47:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 通了 有电了！- 麦克风在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're hot! We're live! - Where are the mikes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.60,1:47:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克风！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.70,1:47:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没麦克风也没用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't work without mikes, Simmons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.00,1:47:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.70,1:48:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快找找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.30,1:48:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 你坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, get in the chair!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.05,1:48:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐下 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get in the chair, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.90,1:48:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把什么都偷走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They steal everything out of this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.20,1:48:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么传出讯号？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get the signal out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.70,1:48:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么联络空军？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we call the Air Force?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.30,1:48:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格伦？- 嗯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glen? - Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.70,1:48:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 你能否把这台电脑…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hotwire this computer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.10,1:48:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,接上无线电 然后送出讯号？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to transmit a tone through the radio?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.40,1:48:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有什么用？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What good is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.50,1:48:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把这台电脑连上无线电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morse code! You can use this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.70,1:48:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后传送莫尔斯电码！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to transmit it through that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.00,1:48:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好！我可以！快点 我看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'll do it! Turn it around. Okay, let's see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.60,1:48:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,西门斯 我要个螺丝刀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simmons, I need a screwdriver!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.20,1:48:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,擎天柱来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Optimus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.70,1:48:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.00,1:48:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.00,1:49:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门堵住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barricade the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.40,1:49:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找些东西 - 小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get something. - Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.90,1:49:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,六 五 四 六 三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six, five, four, six, three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.70,1:49:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着！装弹！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here! Put some rounds in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.90,1:49:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,全局搜索…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master search.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.30,1:49:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成功了 正在发送{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it! We're transmitting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.40,1:49:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,照我说的写{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send exactly what I say!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.60,1:49:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开！快闪开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way! Get out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.60,1:49:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死你！你个小杂碎！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn, you little sucker! Burn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.80,1:49:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是国防部长凯勒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This is Defense Secretary Keller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.80,1:49:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,致北方司令部长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Get me NORTHCOM commander."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.00,1:49:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔！- 喔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! - Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.20,1:49:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才是什么啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.30,1:49:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动紧急步骤 黑鸟1195…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authenticate emergency action. Blackbird 1195…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.30,1:49:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我们确认来自…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I have an authenticated…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.40,1:49:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,国防部长的空袭命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ir strike order from Sec Def.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.30,1:50:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 - 怎么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, no, no. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.30,1:50:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是那辆警车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the same cop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.05,1:50:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,挡住他们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block them, block them, block them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.00,1:50:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.60,1:51:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真酷 妈妈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool, Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.80,1:51:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is so not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.30,1:51:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在柱子后面！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's behind the pillar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.00,1:52:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打死他 - 玛吉 掩护！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shoot that mother… - Maggie, cover fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.30,1:52:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军已经回应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Air Force! They're responding!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.50,1:52:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucker, burn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.20,1:52:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 糟糕！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.90,1:52:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们派F-22到城市去了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! They're sending F-22s to the city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.10,1:52:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛禽 出动！出动！出动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raptors, let's scramble, scramble, scramble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.30,1:52:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击机群整队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike and Dark Star roll call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.50,1:52:47.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（当铺）
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.10,1:52:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 快走！行动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go! Mount up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.70,1:52:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 短波无线电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, I got shortwave radios.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.50,1:52:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我怎么用这玩意？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What am I supposed to do with these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.80,1:52:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,用它联系 只有这个了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, use them! It's all we got!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.50,1:52:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个像是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is like RadioShack…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.60,1:53:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,中古电器行的古董了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}dinosaur radios or something, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.60,1:53:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,范围最多…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only gonna get 20 or 30 miles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.10,1:53:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,20-30英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.60,1:53:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫城市上方的飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any aircraft orbiting the city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.90,1:53:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,12点方向 F-22战斗机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}F-22 at 12:00{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.60,1:53:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 请求飞机空中掩护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I want planes for air cover…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.95,1:53:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让黑鹰直升机来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get Black Hawks on station…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.40,1:53:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,运送能量体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to extract that Cube. You got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.80,1:53:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军到了 放烟雾信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air Force has arrived! Pop smoke!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.50,1:53:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛禽猛禽 能否听到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raptor, Raptor, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.40,1:53:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,能看到你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have you visual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.20,1:53:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,标记是绿色烟雾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green smoke is the mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.70,1:53:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请提供空中掩护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Provide air cover…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.00,1:53:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑鹰机来接我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and vector Black Hawks for extraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.80,1:53:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是红蜘蛛！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Starscream!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.20,1:53:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回应我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me you copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.20,1:53:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 掩护 大黄蜂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up! Take cover! Bumblebee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.30,1:53:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 快躲开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.40,1:53:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 后退 后退！- 快撤！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back up! Back up! - Retreat! Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.70,1:53:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.00,1:54:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人受伤吗？大家没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody hurt? Everyone okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.90,1:54:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,清场！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the area!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.20,1:54:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.60,1:54:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大黄蜂 你的腿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bumblebee? No. Your legs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.90,1:54:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的腿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.80,1:54:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退 后退！你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Here, back, back, back, back! You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.90,1:54:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 大黄蜂 快起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please get up. Bumblebee? Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.90,1:54:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,救护车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ratchet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.00,1:54:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.75,1:54:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.60,1:54:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么我什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, what am I talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.80,1:54:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们向我们开火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shot at us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.60,1:54:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,F-22不可能飞得比房子还低{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}F-22 pilots would never fly below buildings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.10,1:54:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才那个是外星人 不是自己人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's alien. That ain't friendly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.40,1:54:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要站起来 你没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to get up. You're okay. You're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.40,1:55:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.60,1:55:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机接近中 请提供确切方位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Army Black Hawk inbound to your location. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.50,1:55:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,A273度 10英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha 273 degrees, 10 miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.70,1:55:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,N40 往北1.2公里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}November Victor, 1.2 clicks north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.30,1:55:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 行动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.70,1:55:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.40,1:55:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna leave you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.20,1:56:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 霸天虎坏蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Decepticon punk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.60,1:56:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.60,1:56:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中火力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concentrate your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.50,1:57:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.20,1:57:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,威震天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megatron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.70,1:57:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是威震天 快撤退！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Megatron! Retreat! Move! Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.60,1:57:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.20,1:57:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让我们的人离开这！快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get our guys out of the way! Get out of here! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.50,1:57:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这辆车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them out of the buggy! Move out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.60,1:57:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要空中支援 马上要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need air cover down here now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.90,1:57:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 过来帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, help me with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.50,1:57:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这点本事 威震天？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That all you got, Megatron?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.65,1:57:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 小杂种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, little cretin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.90,1:57:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想尝尝厉害么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a piece of me? You want a piece?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.10,1:57:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 来个双份的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I want two!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.00,1:57:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.20,1:57:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 那坦克又起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir! That tank thing's getting back up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.70,1:58:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这些家伙怎么不死呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, these things just don't die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.50,1:58:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我们惨了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we're so dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.10,1:58:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 扣在头部！- 山姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wrap it around the head. - Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.80,1:58:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,能量体呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the Cube?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.90,1:58:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就在这 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right there. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.00,1:58:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它拿过去绕在底盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And take that and wrap it around{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.10,1:58:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后围在脖子上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the base and then put it around his neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.10,1:58:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗？- 艾普斯 让那些黑鹰战机过来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? - Epps, get those Black Hawks here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.20,1:58:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那座楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.50,1:58:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.40,1:58:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让我的人留在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I can't leave my guys back there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.85,1:58:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿着信号弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so here, take this flare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.40,1:58:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边有个白色大楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, there's a tall, white building…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.90,1:58:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有雕塑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with statues on top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.80,1:58:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到楼顶去 拉开信号弹 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go to the roof. Set the flare. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.10,1:58:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开信号弹通知直升机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signal the chopper and set the flare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.05,1:58:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我做不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I can't do this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.10,1:58:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着！你现在是个战士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me! You're a soldier now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.30,1:58:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你带走能量体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? I need you to take this Cube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.60,1:58:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,送回军方手里 这里我们顶着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it into military hands while we hold them off, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.00,1:58:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则会死很多人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a lot of people are gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.20,1:58:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快走 你快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to go. You got to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.95,1:58:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.80,1:58:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得走了 - 不 我不走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need to go. Go. - No, I'm not leaving{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.10,1:58:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大黄蜂不走 我就不能走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}till I get Bumblebee out of here, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.20,1:58:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫黑鹰直升机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Army Black Hawk requested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.40,1:58:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求立刻送走一个男孩和重要物品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immediate evac for civilian boy with precious cargo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.00,1:58:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在房顶上 有信号弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Headed to rooftop marked by flare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.70,1:59:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山姆 我们会掩护你的 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, we will protect you. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.40,1:59:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾普斯 飞机呢？- 山姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Epps, where are those planes? - Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.70,1:59:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论结局会怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what happens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.30,1:59:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都很高兴那天上了你的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really glad I got in that car with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.10,1:59:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆！快行动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! Get to the building! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.80,1:59:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 霸天虎 进攻！- 开火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Decepticons, attack! - Hit it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.80,1:59:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,火力掩护！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.30,1:59:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.20,1:59:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把车开走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl, get that tow truck out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.70,1:59:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going! I'm going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.30,1:59:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.90,2:00:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,威震天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megatron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.10,2:00:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.10,2:00:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类不配活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans don't deserve to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.20,2:00:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要由人类自己决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They deserve to choose for themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.30,2:00:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他们一起去死吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you will die with them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.40,2:00:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一同毁灭！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join them in extinction!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.00,2:01:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续跑 山姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving, Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.70,2:01:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.10,2:01:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.30,2:01:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 快去大楼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, get to the building!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.30,2:02:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把能量体给我 孩子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that Cube, boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.10,2:02:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个臭小子不会把我车撞瘪了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did that jerk just dent my car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.50,2:02:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓不到我的 你抓不到我的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna get me. You're not gonna get me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.30,2:02:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻到你了 臭小子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smell you, boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.60,2:03:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杂种！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.80,2:03:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.00,2:03:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开车 你开枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll drive! You shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.80,2:04:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't going well!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.20,2:04:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪 开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot! Shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.40,2:05:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,打得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.80,2:05:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那坦克这次肯定死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That tank is definitely dead now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.50,2:05:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家继续战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go! We got business!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.70,2:05:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.30,2:05:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！我在这！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I'm over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.00,2:05:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到男孩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.30,2:05:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.10,2:05:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missile!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.80,2:06:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住 山姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.00,2:06:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.00,2:06:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是恐惧还是勇气控制着你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it fear or courage that compels you, fleshling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.60,2:06:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do I go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.40,2:06:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把火种源给我 我饶你不死 当我的宠物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the All Spark and you may live to be my pet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:43.70,2:06:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.50,2:06:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不会给你这个火种源！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never giving you this All Spark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:52.10,2:06:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 真愚钝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so unwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.80,2:07:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,接住你了 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.10,2:07:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱紧能量体！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on to the Cube!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.60,2:07:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦…不… - 真恶心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. Oh, no! - Disgusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.50,2:07:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.80,2:07:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用你的生命保护了能量体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You risked your life to protect the Cube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.80,2:07:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有付出…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sacrifice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.60,2:07:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就没有胜利 - 如果杀不了威震天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- no victory. - If I cannot defeat Megatron, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.00,2:07:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要把能量体塞入我的胸膛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must push the Cube into my chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.90,2:08:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会牺牲自己 与它同归于尽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will sacrifice myself to destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.60,2:08:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲到我身后去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.70,2:08:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你我两个的决斗了 威震天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you and me, Megatron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.40,2:08:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 只有我 擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's just me, Prime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.80,2:08:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,决战结束时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the end of this day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.80,2:08:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜者为王 败者为寇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}one shall stand, one shall fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.30,2:08:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍然在为弱者而战 所以你必输无疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still fight for the weak! That is why you lose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.30,2:08:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,战机60秒后到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighter jets in 60 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.80,2:08:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,两派机器人都有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got friendlies mixed with bad guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.50,2:08:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会用激光标记敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Targets will be marked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.40,2:08:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.60,2:08:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫空袭 明白？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the rain. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.20,2:08:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来消灭这些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's kill these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.20,2:09:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走！- 记住 向下瞄准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move, move, move! - Remember, aim low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.80,2:09:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,盔甲的弱点在胸部下面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armor's weak under the chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.90,2:09:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已被标出 等待中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target marked. Still waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:16.60,2:09:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,20秒钟到达目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time on target, 20 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.60,2:09:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,F-22战机 我们还在等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}F-22s, we're still waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.90,2:09:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.60,2:09:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.30,2:09:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,载弹发射 目标绿色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons armed. Status green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.10,2:10:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.40,2:10:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二波来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second wave's on approach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.50,2:10:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? Break off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.40,2:10:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,2号 锁定 干掉他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, get a lock! Pop that guy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.60,2:10:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯住他 别让他跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay on him. Keep him in your sights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.10,2:10:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.60,2:11:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,2号中弹！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two's down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:10.40,2:11:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.40,2:11:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,火种源是我的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine! All Spark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.20,2:11:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆！快把能量体塞入我的胸膛！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! Put the Cube in my chest! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.70,2:11:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:21.60,2:11:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 山姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.70,2:11:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.90,2:11:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逼得我别无选择 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left me no choice, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:05.50,2:12:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 我欠你一条命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I owe you my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.50,2:12:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都欠你的情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in your debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:30.80,2:12:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,擎天柱 我们没能救他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prime, we couldn't save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:33.30,2:12:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jazz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:38.60,2:12:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去了一位杰出的战友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost a great comrade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.10,2:12:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也结识了新的战友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but gained new ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.20,2:12:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢大家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.90,2:12:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们敬佩你们的勇敢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You honor us with your bravery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:50.30,2:12:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有话要说 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permission to speak, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.70,2:12:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,请讲吧 老朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permission granted, old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.70,2:12:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能说话了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:58.10,2:13:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望和男孩呆在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to stay with the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.10,2:13:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他也同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that is his choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.80,2:13:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.50,2:13:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统已经下令…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, the President has ordered…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.70,2:13:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,将第七区组织解散{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sector Seven be terminated…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.80,2:13:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,处理掉外星人尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the remains of the dead aliens disposed of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.50,2:13:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伦提恩海沟有7英里深{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Laurentian Abyss is seven miles below sea level, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:41.90,2:13:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上最深的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}deepest place on our planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:44.20,2:13:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个深度的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The massive depth and pressure there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:45.95,2:13:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,极高压与极低温{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}coupled with subfreezing temperatures, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:47.90,2:13:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,会把尸体压扁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}would crush and entomb them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:51.90,2:13:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不留任何蛛丝马迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving no evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:00.20,2:14:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,火种源被摧毁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the All Spark gone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.40,2:14:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经无法回到自己的星球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we cannot return life to our planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:06.40,2:14:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,造化弄人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fate has yielded its reward, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:10.50,2:14:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的新家叫做地球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a new world to call home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:19.70,2:14:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和这里的人共同生活 藏在他们眼皮之下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We live among its people now, hiding in plain sight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:24.00,2:14:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也在悄悄地地保护他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but watching over them in secret, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:27.00,2:14:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待 保护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting, protecting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.00,2:14:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我目睹了他们的勇气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have witnessed their capacity for courage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:34.60,2:14:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管和我们来自不同世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And though we are worlds apart, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:37.70,2:14:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但像我们一样 他们也不可貌相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like us, there's more to them than meets the eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:44.20,2:14:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Optimus Prime…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.10,2:14:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里召唤所有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I send this message to any surviving Autobots{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:50.60,2:14:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在宇宙中流亡的汽车人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking refuge among the stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.60,2:14:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:56.90,2:14:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在等待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.20,2:15:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道最近这个地方有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you shed any light on the recent, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:20.75,2:15:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓的外星人活动吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so-called alien activity in the area?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.30,2:15:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what? I think that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.05,2:15:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真有外星人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there was some sort of an alien{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.40,2:15:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 入侵… - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- infestation… - Yeah{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.70,2:15:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的政府{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They, the government, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:35.70,2:15:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,会第一个让我们知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}would be the first to let you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.20,2:15:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府会让我们知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The government would let us know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:39.00,2:15:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是说 这里是美国 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, this is America. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:40.70,2:15:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因为那样 我们才知道 我们生活在一片自由的土地上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that's how we know we live in a free land, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:43.30,2:15:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为没有秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because there's no secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:45.00,2:15:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会说“嘿 快找掩护”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd say, "Hey! Duck and cover."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:57.10,2:15:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的头和电视里面…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head is kind of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:58.20,2:16:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点不一样大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a different size than it is on television.{\r}
